      <activity id="1afe5c21-3a7d-52b3-8b57-4b7b1b180c52" activityNameId="27476662-1b3f-5294-8506-38f69fc1c4a3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Concrete, normal, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Concrete, normal, at plant
Part of total Swiss concrete production: 55%. Density: 2'380 kg/m3. Ingredients: Cement 300 kg, Water 190 kg, Gravel 1'890 kg. Wastewater is an average from data on 11 German concrete mixing plant.;
Synonyms: Transportbeton, ready mixed concrete, B 35/25 with CEM I 42.5; 
UUID: 9dc7ef6a-1dcc-3968-b7ac-675141e0f5fa
includes the whole manufacturing processes to produce ready-mixed concrete, internal processes (transport, etc.) and infrastructure. No administration is included. Special outputs: wastewater, average data of 11 German concrete plants
Location: For some exchanges RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: Typical technology for average Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 4730000 t/a
Sampling: Measured data of 6 Swiss plants 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9dc7ef6a-1dcc-3968-b7ac-675141e0f5fa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
